{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act43side_level_act43side_05_end","storyGroup":"act43side","storySort":12,"storyDependence":"act43side_level_act43side_05_beg","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"AD-5","storyName":"终将重逢","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"米兰妮讲述与玛丽安娜过往的竞争，深受感染的蒂比决定帮助她设计出最完美的场景。在“灵感之神”的有意引导下，卢西恩成为斯蒂芬的创作突破口，和最后一场戏的主演。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act43side/level_act43side_05_end","avgTag":"行动后","unLockType":"BY_START_TIME","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act43side_05","minState":"PASS","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":10,"next":12,"characters":["米兰妮","蒂比","记者","玛丽安娜","？？？","新人助理","资深统筹","斯蒂芬","卢西恩","格蕾塔","剧作家","剧团长"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":1},{"type":"stopmusic","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":4},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5C/Avg_bg_62_g12_dressingroom.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":5},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":6},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":7},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$warm_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_warm_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":8,"musicid":0},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1830_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":9},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#2$1","duration":"1","id":10},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":11},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1830_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":12},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米兰妮","text":"蒂比，我对“杜邦夫人”谢幕的场景构建有几个初步的构想。","id":13,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/D1/Avg_avg_npc_1830_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米兰妮","text":"你干过的工种多，又是专业的场景喷绘师，我需要你帮我一起做出最佳的场景设计。","id":14,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/D1/Avg_avg_npc_1830_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米兰妮","text":"这是我随手整理的一些资料，可以先看看......","id":15,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/D1/Avg_avg_npc_1830_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":16},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":17},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_paper1","volume":"1","id":18},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":19},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":20},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"哇......这么多美术元素和影片参考？","id":21,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4A/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"色调、氛围、设计理念......包括建筑的细节和不同构件之间的光感差异都有标注！","id":22,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4A/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":23},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"米兰妮女士，您到底从多久前就开始研究这场戏了？","id":24,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/D8/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1830_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":25},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米兰妮","text":"近几年，我最不缺的就是时间。想拍出优秀的作品，只是把戏照本宣科地演完是远远不够的。","id":26,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/D1/Avg_avg_npc_1830_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#10$1","focus":"r","id":27},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"明明斯蒂芬导演都还没修改出满意的剧本，您就为“杜邦夫人”的结局做了那么多的想象？","id":28,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/28/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1830_1#4$1","focus":"l","id":29},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米兰妮","text":"到现在那个小伙子都没交出结局的台本。我想，作为《杜邦夫人之死》的主演兼投资人，我有义务对作品负责。","id":30,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/EF/Avg_avg_npc_1830_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1830_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":31},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米兰妮","text":"而且我说过，杜邦夫人怎么在戏里好看地死，决定了我怎么在蓝卡坞漂亮地重生。","id":32,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/32/Avg_avg_npc_1830_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":33},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"《鲁珀坎假日》《艾琳·达斯的画像》《断桥遗梦》......这些背景氛围的参考影片不都是玛丽安娜女士的作品吗？","id":34,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4A/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1830_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":35},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米兰妮","text":"你......喜欢玛丽安娜·布莱克？","id":36,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/59/Avg_avg_npc_1830_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米兰妮","text":"她可在你出生之前就告别银幕了。","id":37,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/59/Avg_avg_npc_1830_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":38},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"呃......我、我老爹很喜欢她的作品！再说了，经典永不过时。","id":39,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/D8/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1830_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":40},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米兰妮","text":"她的演技和挑选剧本的品味无可挑剔。","id":41,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/D1/Avg_avg_npc_1830_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":42},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"真意外......我本来以为您会很不喜欢玛丽安娜女士，毕竟你们被放在一起比较了那么多年。","id":43,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8E/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1830_1#4$1","focus":"l","id":44},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米兰妮","text":"是啊，那么多年......","id":45,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/EF/Avg_avg_npc_1830_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":46},{"type":"dialog","id":47},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":48},{"type":"charslot","id":49},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":50},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","fadetime":"0","keep":"true","initamount":"0","amount":"1","block":"true","id":51},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/E6/Avg_bg_29_g7_mainstreet_n.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":52},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":53},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":54},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_crwddiscuss_outside","loop":"true","channel":"bgs","volume":"0","id":55},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.4","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"2","id":56},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_victorianormal_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":57,"musicid":1},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","fadetime":"2","amount":"0","block":"true","id":58},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1840_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":59},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":60},{"type":"playsound","key":"$skill_flash","volume":"1","id":61},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":62},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.1","block":"true","id":63},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":64},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":65},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":66},{"type":"dialogue","name":"记者","text":"玛丽安娜女士，恭喜您斩获演艺生涯的第八个最佳女主角奖！","id":67},{"type":"dialogue","name":"记者","text":"自入行以来，您几乎每一年都有作品提名或获奖，业内都认为您将是新人演员无法逾越的高山。","id":68},{"type":"dialogue","name":"记者","text":"在您看来，现在的影坛是否有值得期待的后辈呢？","id":69},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1840_1#1$1","id":70},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玛丽安娜","text":"感谢您的赞扬，记者先生，不过“无法逾越的高山”言过其实，我也仍在攀登的路上。","id":71,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0E/Avg_avg_npc_1840_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玛丽安娜","text":"蓝卡坞无时无刻不在涌入极富潜力的新人，我很难说出某个具体的名字——","id":72,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0E/Avg_avg_npc_1840_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":73},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"米兰妮·卢瑟福德。","id":74},{"type":"dialog","id":75},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_highheelfts","id":76},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":77},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米兰妮","text":"玛丽安娜女士，请接受我的鞠躬致意。","id":78},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米兰妮","text":"我今天拿到了最佳女配角，相比您获得这个奖项所花费的时间，慢了整整两年。","id":79},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1840_1#1$1","id":80},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玛丽安娜","text":"......","id":81,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0E/Avg_avg_npc_1840_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":82},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米兰妮","text":"我看过您的所有作品，如刚刚那位记者朋友所说，您确实是天生的演员，是蓝卡坞目前难以逾越的高山......但也只是目前。","id":83},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米兰妮","text":"请再给我一段时间，我一定会超越您。","id":84},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1840_1#1$1","id":85},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玛丽安娜","text":"我很期待。","id":86,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0E/Avg_avg_npc_1840_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":87},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"2","id":88},{"type":"dialog","id":89},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":90},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":91},{"type":"charslot","id":92},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":93},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/61/Avg_bg_62_g2_setting_rooftop.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":94},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":95},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":96},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$darkness01_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta1_180603/m_dia_darkness01_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":97,"musicid":2},{"type":"dialogue","name":"新人助理","text":"哇......米兰妮跟玛丽安娜在同场飙戏欸，好酷。","id":98},{"type":"dialogue","name":"新人助理","text":"她俩不对付很久了吧？最近一段时间两人拿奖的速度像在比赛似的......怎么会答应出演同一部戏？","id":99},{"type":"charslot","id":100},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米兰妮","text":"......","id":101},{"type":"charslot","id":102},{"type":"dialogue","name":"资深统筹","text":"嘘！没礼貌的小子，你进组的时候没经过培训吗！快跟米兰妮女士鞠躬道歉！","id":103},{"type":"dialogue","name":"新人助理","text":"对、对不起！","id":104},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1840_1#1$1","id":105},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玛丽安娜","text":"何苦对新来的孩子那么严苛呢，米兰妮？","id":106,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0E/Avg_avg_npc_1840_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":107},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米兰妮","text":"“我们的电影建立在一套又一套规则之上”，玛丽安娜女士，您入行比我久，应该对这句话体会更深。","id":108},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米兰妮","text":"所谓女明星的礼遇，都是我们靠一个个角色、一部部电影挣来的，它让我这样一个小城市来的小女孩，如今能站在您的对面。","id":109},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米兰妮","text":"如果没有规则，电影将没有标准，那我们之间的输赢要怎么衡量呢？","id":110},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1840_1#1$1","id":111},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玛丽安娜","text":"你提醒我了，我还没祝贺你前几天凭新作获得了莱塔尼亚“高塔电影展”最佳女主演。","id":112,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0E/Avg_avg_npc_1840_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":113},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米兰妮","text":"那只是一个很小的评选，而您的新片再一次包揽了蓝卡坞的各大奖项。","id":114},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米兰妮","text":"我还没真正超越您，玛丽安娜女士。","id":115},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":116},{"type":"dialog","id":117},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":118},{"type":"charslot","id":119},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":120},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/52/Avg_bg_62_g1_setting_lobby.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":121},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":122},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":123},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$Tremont_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act25side/m_avg_tremont_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":124,"musicid":3},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1840_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":125},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":126},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玛丽安娜","text":"很感谢各位前来参加《在永夜里燃烧的晨星》的发布会......","id":127,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0E/Avg_avg_npc_1840_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玛丽安娜","text":"这段时间感谢各位的关心。剧组确实在拍摄过程中遭遇了天灾，我受了伤，现在仍在恢复当中。","id":128,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0E/Avg_avg_npc_1840_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玛丽安娜","text":"所幸，那次拍摄不是无功而返，在众人的帮助下我们依旧留下了一些珍贵的画面......","id":129,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0E/Avg_avg_npc_1840_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1840_1#3$1","id":130},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玛丽安娜","text":"但我想，或许这是上天冥冥之中给我的启示——是的，玛丽安娜即将告别银幕。","id":131,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/E4/Avg_avg_npc_1840_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玛丽安娜","text":"作为《在永夜里燃烧的晨星》的主演兼投资人，我宣布，这部电影及我本人，不会参与任何奖项的评选。","id":132,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/E4/Avg_avg_npc_1840_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1840_1#1$1","id":133},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玛丽安娜","text":"它仅仅是“玛丽安娜”，留给影迷朋友的最后的礼物。","id":134,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0E/Avg_avg_npc_1840_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玛丽安娜","text":"当然，我不会马上离开蓝卡坞，我会暂时转入幕后......","id":135,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0E/Avg_avg_npc_1840_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玛丽安娜","text":"但或许不久后，我就会尝试接触其他机会......作为“雅拉·布克·威尔森”，开启新的人生。","id":136,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0E/Avg_avg_npc_1840_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":137},{"type":"charslot","id":138},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_crwddiscuss_outside","loop":"true","channel":"bgs","volume":"0","id":139},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.6","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"1","id":140},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":141},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米兰妮","text":"......","id":142},{"type":"dialogue","name":"记者","text":"米兰妮女士，原来您也来了......能对您做个简单的采访吗？","id":143},{"type":"dialogue","name":"记者","text":"您主演的新片也将在近期上映，根据多家平台预测，您与玛丽安娜女士将是今年蓝卡坞电影节最佳女主演的唯二竞争者......","id":144},{"type":"dialogue","name":"记者","text":"玛丽安娜女士突然宣告息影，她的新片也退出各大奖项的角逐......您的心情如何？","id":145},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米兰妮","text":"我这算是......","id":146},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米兰妮","text":"赢了吗？","id":147},{"type":"dialog","id":148},{"type":"playsound","key":"$skill_flash","volume":"1","id":149},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":150},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.1","block":"true","id":151},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":152},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":153},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","fadetime":"2","keep":"true","initamount":"0","amount":"1","block":"true","id":154},{"type":"dialog","id":155},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"2","id":156},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":157},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":158},{"type":"charslot","id":159},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","fadetime":"0","amount":"0","block":"true","id":160},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":161},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1830_1#1$1","id":162},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#1$1","id":163},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5C/Avg_bg_62_g12_dressingroom.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":164},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":165},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":166},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_calm_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":167,"musicid":4},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":168},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"雅拉——呃，玛丽安娜女士息影之后，您的广告代言和片约不断，还受邀担任了著名电影节的评审。","id":169,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4A/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#9$1","focus":"r","id":170},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"但不久之后，您突然因为一些......琐事，短暂离开了大众视野，等您再回归影坛的时候——","id":171,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/97/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1830_1#4$1","focus":"l","id":172},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米兰妮","text":"一切都不一样了。","id":173,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/EF/Avg_avg_npc_1830_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米兰妮","text":"她息影的消息带给我不小的冲击，但我仍旧很自信，自己是依靠天赋登上的顶峰，我赢得很漂亮。","id":174,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/EF/Avg_avg_npc_1830_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米兰妮","text":"我能像她一样成为“无法逾越的高山”，成为另一个银幕传奇，甚至超过她。","id":175,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/EF/Avg_avg_npc_1830_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米兰妮","text":"结果，蓝卡坞最佳女主演米兰妮·卢瑟福德在影评人的赞扬、赞助商的阿谀，以及观众的掌声中彻底迷失了方向......","id":176,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/EF/Avg_avg_npc_1830_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米兰妮","text":"财富和名利、绯闻与酒精......那几年，我过得很......不体面。","id":177,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/EF/Avg_avg_npc_1830_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#6$1","focus":"r","id":178},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"我看过相关的报道......那些八卦小报不该肆意编排您的私生活！","id":179,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/06/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"米兰妮女士，见到您本人后我就知道，或许您确实曾走入误区，但您对表演的爱无容置疑。","id":180,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/06/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1830_1#4$1","focus":"l","id":181},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米兰妮","text":"不用安慰我，小黎博利，没人比我更清楚我的失败。","id":182,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/EF/Avg_avg_npc_1830_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1830_1#6$1","focus":"l","id":183},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米兰妮","text":"玛丽安娜可以在训练有素的军人和出身贫贱的女仆中来回切换，她仅彩排一遍就能精准把控灯光定点和站位。","id":184,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/43/Avg_avg_npc_1830_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米兰妮","text":"而我但凡请一天假，少花一个小时研读台本，晚到十五分钟排演动线，我的表演状态都会大打折扣。","id":185,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/43/Avg_avg_npc_1830_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1830_1#4$1","focus":"l","id":186},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米兰妮","text":"短短两年纸醉金迷的生活就会让我彻底失去原本信手拈来的技巧，令导演和影迷大失所望。","id":187,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/EF/Avg_avg_npc_1830_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米兰妮","text":"我从未意识到会有多少演员前仆后继地追赶着我的身影，我从未意识到玛丽安娜在影坛十几年固守的演员地位，代表了什么。","id":188,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/EF/Avg_avg_npc_1830_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米兰妮","text":"我以为自己只是跟她一样，享受电影和生活的双重乐趣，我以为在漫长的追逐和竞争之后，短暂犒劳自己无伤大雅。","id":189,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/EF/Avg_avg_npc_1830_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1830_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":190},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米兰妮","text":"那时我才终于明白，玛丽安娜·布莱克是个令人恨得牙痒的天才......各个方面。","id":191,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/D1/Avg_avg_npc_1830_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米兰妮","text":"最后的作品，偶遇的天灾......玛丽安娜受到的启示是告别银幕，而我却想感叹连难以捉摸的自然都在帮她。","id":192,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/D1/Avg_avg_npc_1830_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":193},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"但您现在重新回到了女主演的位置，您可以重新获得所有人的信任。","id":194,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4A/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"甚至，您现在也得到了在天灾之下拍戏的机会！","id":195,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4A/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1830_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":196},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米兰妮","text":"没错。我花了十多年才捡回自信和对表演的感觉，只差一步就有可能重回巅峰。","id":197,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/D1/Avg_avg_npc_1830_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米兰妮","text":"格蕾塔挑了个恰到好处的时机邀请我出演《杜邦夫人之死》，现在她旺盛的野心还多送了我一份特殊的“小礼物”。","id":198,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/D1/Avg_avg_npc_1830_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米兰妮","text":"杜邦夫人多像我啊......","id":199,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/D1/Avg_avg_npc_1830_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1830_1#4$1","focus":"l","id":200},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米兰妮","text":"她难道真的不知道自己被兄长欺骗？她难道对虚假的姓氏毫无察觉吗？","id":201,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/EF/Avg_avg_npc_1830_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米兰妮","text":"不，她在潜意识中贪恋金碧辉煌的生活，拒绝接受自己出身平庸的真相。她希望自己是特别的，有天赋的。","id":202,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/EF/Avg_avg_npc_1830_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1830_1#6$1","focus":"l","id":203},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米兰妮","text":"......","id":204,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/43/Avg_avg_npc_1830_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米兰妮","text":"风暴之中，她会面临什么样的结局呢？","id":205,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/43/Avg_avg_npc_1830_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":206},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"米兰妮女士。","id":207,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4A/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1830_1#6$1","focus":"l","id":208},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米兰妮","text":"嗯？","id":209,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/43/Avg_avg_npc_1830_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#11$1","focus":"r","id":210},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"我们来看恐怖片吧！","id":211,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/71/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1830_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":212},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米兰妮","text":"恐怖片......？","id":213,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/59/Avg_avg_npc_1830_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":214},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"既然要重回巅峰，那就不能一味参考玛丽安娜女士的作品呀，两位本来就是不同风格的演员。","id":215,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4A/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"我们要想出比《鲁珀坎假日》更具感染力的场景设计，让“杜邦夫人”最后的落幕留名影史！","id":216,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4A/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1830_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":217},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米兰妮","text":"好。","id":218,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/32/Avg_avg_npc_1830_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":219},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"另外，米兰妮女士。","id":220,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8E/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"我不了解您和玛丽安娜女士之间的往事，但我认为她对您终有一天能超越“玛丽安娜·布莱克”的认同，是真心实意的。","id":221,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8E/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"或许现在也依旧如此。","id":222,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8E/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1830_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":223},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米兰妮","text":"......","id":224,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/D1/Avg_avg_npc_1830_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米兰妮","text":"或许吧。","id":225,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/D1/Avg_avg_npc_1830_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":226},{"type":"dialog","id":227},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":228},{"type":"charslot","id":229},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":230},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/16/Avg_bg_62_g13_directorstudio.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":231},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":232},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":233},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$plot_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_plot_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":234,"musicid":5},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1835_1#3$1","duration":"1","id":235},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":236},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯蒂芬","text":"你、你......你是切实存在的个体还是我发烫头颅中的臆想？“神”真的来到了我面前？","id":237,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/E1/Avg_avg_npc_1835_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯蒂芬","text":"难道我真的已经被写剧本逼疯了......","id":238,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/E1/Avg_avg_npc_1835_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":239},{"type":"charslot","id":240},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":241},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1829_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","bstart":"0.3","bend":"0.6","id":242},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":243},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"疯狂能让墨迹在纸卷上结出甘美的果实，让僵化呆板的思维遨游于无序的时空。","id":244,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FC/Avg_avg_npc_1829_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"你卑微地躲在夜晚的角落，被迫近的日程追赶，目睹惨无人道的凶案，却只能苦思冥想出三种杜邦夫人的结局......","id":245,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FC/Avg_avg_npc_1829_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"何来被逼疯一说呢？","id":246,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FC/Avg_avg_npc_1829_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1835_1#4$1","id":247},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯蒂芬","text":"......","id":248,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2B/Avg_avg_npc_1835_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯蒂芬","text":"我答应过格蕾塔女士今晚必须改出令所有人满意的结局，那群为了拍摄连命都不在乎的人正等着我的指示。","id":249,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2B/Avg_avg_npc_1835_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯蒂芬","text":"但他们错信了人。","id":250,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2B/Avg_avg_npc_1835_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯蒂芬","text":"艺术领域只能接受才华横溢的天之骄子，而不是一个枯坐在打字机前的废物！","id":251,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2B/Avg_avg_npc_1835_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1829_1#1$1","bstart":"0.3","bend":"0.6","id":252},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"《杜邦夫人之死》，你在标题里已经给故事定下了诱人的终点。","id":253,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FC/Avg_avg_npc_1829_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"虽然那位女士的死亡在胶片的复制下、在一遍遍的放映中会失去原本震撼人心的光彩......","id":254,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FC/Avg_avg_npc_1829_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"但蓝卡坞就是这样一座向泰拉各处兜售幻梦的工厂不是吗？","id":255,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FC/Avg_avg_npc_1829_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"你们擅长欺骗，连自己都不放过——哥伦比亚的第一个美梦正是在拓荒宣传片里诞生。","id":256,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FC/Avg_avg_npc_1829_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"那些涉及政治的隐喻和真相我并不在意，只是你们误解了戏剧的本质，就算它操纵生活，也并非是用这种机械的方式。","id":257,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FC/Avg_avg_npc_1829_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"不过，你将死亡作为杜邦夫人的终局，足以证明你对戏剧尚存直觉性的判断。","id":258,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FC/Avg_avg_npc_1829_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1835_1#7$1","id":259},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯蒂芬","text":"直觉？","id":260,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4A/Avg_avg_npc_1835_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1835_1#1$1","id":261},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯蒂芬","text":"不。","id":262,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2A/Avg_avg_npc_1835_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯蒂芬","text":"学生时期我一直痛恨将死亡纳入自己写的故事之中。","id":263,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2A/Avg_avg_npc_1835_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯蒂芬","text":"我认为它是一种投机取巧的手段，只是为了解决编剧难以处理的漏洞，或是功能性地煽动某种情绪。","id":264,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2A/Avg_avg_npc_1835_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯蒂芬","text":"真正有才能的作者不会将影片的高潮设置在这种情节上。","id":265,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2A/Avg_avg_npc_1835_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1829_1#1$1","bstart":"0.3","bend":"0.6","id":266},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"有什么改变了你......一段震撼人心的记忆，或是一阵无法回想的幻痛？","id":267,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FC/Avg_avg_npc_1829_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1835_1#1$1","id":268},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯蒂芬","text":"五年前，我和格蕾塔女士合作的时候遇到了跟现在一样的问题。","id":269,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2A/Avg_avg_npc_1835_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯蒂芬","text":"她言辞犀利地指出我的故事后期太过平淡，无法吸引观众持续的注意力，如果不做修改，这部电影的票房不会好看。","id":270,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2A/Avg_avg_npc_1835_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯蒂芬","text":"我像今天这样把自己闷在房间里，无限接近于崩溃的边缘，也无法给出解决方案......","id":271,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2A/Avg_avg_npc_1835_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1835_1#4$1","id":272},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯蒂芬","text":"就在这时，劳拉坠亡了。","id":273,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2B/Avg_avg_npc_1835_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1829_1#1$1","bstart":"0.3","bend":"0.6","id":274},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"天赐的时机，绝佳的桥段。","id":275,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FC/Avg_avg_npc_1829_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1835_1#5$1","id":276},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯蒂芬","text":"如格蕾塔女士所料，电影的其他部分被评论家口诛笔伐，只有这幕戏被所有人津津乐道，甚至......","id":277,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F9/Avg_avg_npc_1835_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1829_1#1$1","bstart":"0.3","bend":"0.6","id":278},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"连你都开始认同死亡不是投机取巧，而是充满艺术性的真挚表达。","id":279,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FC/Avg_avg_npc_1829_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1835_1#7$1","id":280},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯蒂芬","text":"没错......","id":281,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4A/Avg_avg_npc_1835_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1829_1#1$1","bstart":"0.3","bend":"0.6","id":282},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"既然你幡然醒悟，这片地块上发生的一切都该成为你的养料。","id":283,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FC/Avg_avg_npc_1829_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"死于戏中，听信幻觉，吊于横梁......素材和灵感俯拾皆是，为什么不直接将它们写进故事，让银幕内外上演同样的戏剧？","id":284,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FC/Avg_avg_npc_1829_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1835_1#7$1","id":285},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯蒂芬","text":"......","id":286,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4A/Avg_avg_npc_1835_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯蒂芬","text":"不够好。","id":287,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4A/Avg_avg_npc_1835_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1829_1#1$1","bstart":"0.3","bend":"0.6","id":288},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"那将目光从这些已经穷尽了可能性的人身上移开如何？","id":289,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FC/Avg_avg_npc_1829_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1835_1#7$1","id":290},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯蒂芬","text":"什、什么意思？","id":291,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4A/Avg_avg_npc_1835_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1829_1#1$1","bstart":"0.3","bend":"0.6","id":292},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"在你的故事中，还有谁能激起“杜邦夫人”内心的火花？还有谁游离于所有恩怨情仇之外，却又能带来最戏剧性的效果——","id":293,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FC/Avg_avg_npc_1829_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"和最完美的表演？","id":294,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FC/Avg_avg_npc_1829_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":295},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1835_1#3$1","id":296},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":297},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯蒂芬","text":"“信使”......是信使带来了噩耗！是他开启了杜邦夫人新的宿命！","id":298,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/E1/Avg_avg_npc_1835_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯蒂芬","text":"复仇还是忏悔？杜邦夫人有了一个新的选择，而与此同时，信使也必须面对介入他人命运后导向的因果......","id":299,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/E1/Avg_avg_npc_1835_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1835_1#5$1","id":300},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯蒂芬","text":"这就是我想要的结局......就是这个！","id":301,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F9/Avg_avg_npc_1835_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯蒂芬","text":"卢西恩......没错......要让卢西恩成为最后一幕的主演......","id":302,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F9/Avg_avg_npc_1835_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":303},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":304},{"type":"charslot","id":305},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":306},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#1$1","id":307},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1B/Avg_bg_62_g10_dormitory.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":308},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":309},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":310},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"由我担当主演......","id":311,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1834_1#1$1","id":312},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"没错。","id":313,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A6/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"我对你本人算不上了解，但我有预感，即使我今晚没有来找你，你也会来找我。","id":314,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A6/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"你是我见过最具潜力的演员之一。","id":315,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A6/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"“信使”一角出场次数寥寥，但你的表演为原本空洞的角色增添了更加复杂细腻的内核。","id":316,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A6/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"无论你有何目的，我确信在拍摄结束之前，你不会离开这里。","id":317,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A6/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"既然如此，为何不慷慨地帮我这个忙呢？","id":318,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A6/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#5$1","id":319},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"......","id":320,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/EA/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1834_1#1$1","id":321},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"当然，你还有时间考虑。这只是一个初步的想法，我还没来得及跟斯蒂芬沟通。","id":322,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A6/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1834_1#6$1","id":323},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"他答应我今晚一定会修改出结局，说实话我对此并不乐观。","id":324,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/66/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1834_1#8$1","id":325},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"但愿他的“神”敲响了他的房门。","id":326,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B7/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":327},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":328},{"type":"charslot","id":329},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":330},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1835_1#2$1","id":331},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/16/Avg_bg_62_g13_directorstudio.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":332},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":333},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":334},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯蒂芬","text":"原来如此......仅仅将焦点转移到信使身上就能衍生出如此精彩绝伦的剧情走向！","id":335,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B8/Avg_avg_npc_1835_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯蒂芬","text":"我能想象成稿之后，结尾的那场戏会有多么震撼。","id":336,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B8/Avg_avg_npc_1835_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1835_1#7$1","id":337},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯蒂芬","text":"不过——","id":338,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4A/Avg_avg_npc_1835_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯蒂芬","text":"“信使”台词旁的批注是否过于详细了？","id":339,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4A/Avg_avg_npc_1835_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯蒂芬","text":"在指导我写作时，您向我讲述了卢西恩先生表演的特点和念白时断句的习惯。","id":340,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4A/Avg_avg_npc_1835_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯蒂芬","text":"甚至连哪种角度的特写最适合展现他细腻的表情，哪种强弱的灯光最能加强他独特的个人气质都一清二楚......","id":341,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4A/Avg_avg_npc_1835_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯蒂芬","text":"仿佛您从很早以前就认识他，甚至教导过他——","id":342,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4A/Avg_avg_npc_1835_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯蒂芬","text":"您为何对卢西恩如此熟悉？","id":343,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4A/Avg_avg_npc_1835_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1829_1#1$1","bstart":"0.3","bend":"0.6","id":344},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"......","id":345,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FC/Avg_avg_npc_1829_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":346},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":347},{"type":"charslot","id":348},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":349},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","fadetime":"0","keep":"true","initamount":"0","amount":"1","block":"true","id":350},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F2/Avg_bg_24_RL_castlehall.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":351},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":352},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":353},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","fadetime":"2","amount":"0","block":"true","id":354},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"0.7","id":355},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_292_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":356},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":357},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧作家","text":"剧团长，您唤我？","id":358,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/11/Avg_avg_npc_292_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1829_1#1$1","id":359},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团长","text":"笔者，与我同行。","id":360,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FC/Avg_avg_npc_1829_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_292_1#1$1","id":361},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧作家","text":"最后一幕戏还在进行，像往常一样，所有观众的注意力都被舞台上的“表演”死死抓住了。","id":362,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/11/Avg_avg_npc_292_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_292_1#4$1","id":363},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧作家","text":"“白英花”难得重返舞台，您不打算在整个演出结束后为她庆祝吗？","id":364,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1F/Avg_avg_npc_292_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1829_1#4$1","id":365},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团长","text":"......","id":366,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6D/Avg_avg_npc_1829_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1829_1#1$1","id":367},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团长","text":"“血钻”与“沉渊”呢？","id":368,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FC/Avg_avg_npc_1829_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_292_1#1$1","id":369},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧作家","text":"在这场演出中他们只是配角，所有戏份已在上一幕结束......","id":370,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/11/Avg_avg_npc_292_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_292_1#9$1","id":371},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧作家","text":"朽坏的舞台机关让“魔术师助手”与被选中登台的“幸运观众”血染当场，他们的尸身被塞进道具箱，沿河漂流，永远消失......","id":372,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5D/Avg_avg_npc_292_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧作家","text":"踩着还未干透的鲜血，魔术师本人将在舞台上完成最后的谢幕秀。","id":373,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5D/Avg_avg_npc_292_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_292_1#1$1","id":374},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧作家","text":"“血钻”与“沉渊”此刻应该已经钻出了道具箱，正在赶回来与饰演魔术师的“白英花”一同谢幕。","id":375,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/11/Avg_avg_npc_292_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1829_1#1$1","id":376},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团长","text":"是吗？","id":377,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FC/Avg_avg_npc_1829_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1829_1#2$1","text":"","id":378},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团长","text":"我还以为这两个孩子会如戏中一样，永远消失......","id":379,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/02/Avg_avg_npc_1829_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_292_1#4$1","id":380},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧作家","text":"——","id":381,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1F/Avg_avg_npc_292_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1829_1#2$1","id":382},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团长","text":"我记得这出戏是你半年前重制剧本时新增的吧......在一个号称得到启迪的夜晚？","id":383,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/02/Avg_avg_npc_1829_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_292_1#6$1","id":384},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧作家","text":"剧团长......","id":385,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0F/Avg_avg_npc_292_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1829_1#11$1","id":386},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团长","text":"笔者，与我同行。","id":387,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1F/Avg_avg_npc_1829_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团长","text":"......演出远未结束。","id":388,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1F/Avg_avg_npc_1829_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":389},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","fadetime":"2","keep":"true","initamount":"0","amount":"1","block":"true","id":390},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":391},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":392},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"他是我最青睐的主角。","id":393,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1F/Avg_avg_npc_1829_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"他曾离开，却终会与我重逢。","id":394,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1F/Avg_avg_npc_1829_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":395},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","fadetime":"0","amount":"0","block":"true","id":396},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":397},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":398},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":399},{"type":"image","id":400},{"type":"charslot","id":401}],"characters":["米兰妮","蒂比","记者","玛丽安娜","？？？","新人助理","资深统筹","斯蒂芬","卢西恩","格蕾塔","剧作家","剧团长"]}